{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Corporate Cut: The Hair-Raising Adventure of an Office Employee",
    "steam_appid": 3250150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s your first day as the new intern at the Star Cut Magazine company and you notice very early that something is off: all the employees talk about hair, they have the same haircut, and no one is friendly to you. Moreover, they seem to have forgotten what innovation and originality are, together with the old spirit of the company. It\u2019s time to step up and find out what the hair happened to the company\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/da0abdf81eb6a5ef07d182707d7134bf.poster.avif?t=1729865627\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/da0abdf81eb6a5ef07d182707d7134bf.webm?t=1729865627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/da0abdf81eb6a5ef07d182707d7134bf.mp4?t=1729865627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the story of the company</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to understand what is going on in the office and most importantly understand why you were hired if everyone treats you badly. Get to know the company\u2019s story by talking to your colleagues and by exploring an office filled with environmental storytelling elements, combs, brushes, scissors, and \u201cfishy\u201d stuff\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/33aebef8b5e759c676c76c867b4a0fcd.poster.avif?t=1729865627\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/33aebef8b5e759c676c76c867b4a0fcd.webm?t=1729865627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/33aebef8b5e759c676c76c867b4a0fcd.mp4?t=1729865627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring back the originality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your colleagues seem to have lost their sense of initiative. There\u2019s no better way to solve the issue than by showing your willingness and think out of the hair - pardon - out of the box. Complete the tasks you are assigned by solving fetch quests and environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/e38c7af79c9a49807df78477b167e0dd.poster.avif?t=1729865627\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/e38c7af79c9a49807df78477b167e0dd.webm?t=1729865627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/e38c7af79c9a49807df78477b167e0dd.mp4?t=1729865627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who we are</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporate Cut is a small indie game made by 7 students coming together for the Game World Design course at ITU Copenhagen. We presented the game at TAGS, during the Copenhagen Gaming Week 2024, and won the award for \u201cBest Student Game\u201d. We also showcased the game at the Nordic Game Conference 2024 Malm\u00f6, Sweden. We are happy to share this little design experiment with you. If you wish to contact us directly, feel free to reach out via social media!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you very much for playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-The team at Hairington Games</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s your first day as the new intern at the Star Cut Magazine company and you notice very early that something is off: all the employees talk about hair, they have the same haircut, and no one is friendly to you. Moreover, they seem to have forgotten what innovation and originality are, together with the old spirit of the company. It\u2019s time to step up and find out what the hair happened to the company\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/da0abdf81eb6a5ef07d182707d7134bf.poster.avif?t=1729865627\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/da0abdf81eb6a5ef07d182707d7134bf.webm?t=1729865627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/da0abdf81eb6a5ef07d182707d7134bf.mp4?t=1729865627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the story of the company</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to understand what is going on in the office and most importantly understand why you were hired if everyone treats you badly. Get to know the company\u2019s story by talking to your colleagues and by exploring an office filled with environmental storytelling elements, combs, brushes, scissors, and \u201cfishy\u201d stuff\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/33aebef8b5e759c676c76c867b4a0fcd.poster.avif?t=1729865627\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/33aebef8b5e759c676c76c867b4a0fcd.webm?t=1729865627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/33aebef8b5e759c676c76c867b4a0fcd.mp4?t=1729865627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring back the originality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your colleagues seem to have lost their sense of initiative. There\u2019s no better way to solve the issue than by showing your willingness and think out of the hair - pardon - out of the box. Complete the tasks you are assigned by solving fetch quests and environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/e38c7af79c9a49807df78477b167e0dd.poster.avif?t=1729865627\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/e38c7af79c9a49807df78477b167e0dd.webm?t=1729865627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250150/extras/e38c7af79c9a49807df78477b167e0dd.mp4?t=1729865627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who we are</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporate Cut is a small indie game made by 7 students coming together for the Game World Design course at ITU Copenhagen. We presented the game at TAGS, during the Copenhagen Gaming Week 2024, and won the award for \u201cBest Student Game\u201d. We also showcased the game at the Nordic Game Conference 2024 Malm\u00f6, Sweden. We are happy to share this little design experiment with you. If you wish to contact us directly, feel free to reach out via social media!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you very much for playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-The team at Hairington Games</i></p>",
    "short_description": "\u201cCorporate Cut\u201d is a satirical adventure set in a bizarre hair-obsessed magazine company. As the new intern, you\u2019ll experience the struggle to fit in while exploring the boundaries between conformity and innovation. Expect intricate lore, experimental game design, and of course\u2026 many hair puns!",
